>> title: Banana Bread
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: banana, quick bread, breakfast, oven
>> counters: Bakery, Diner
>> aka: banana loaf, banana nut bread
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 20 min

Grease a #9x5-in loaf pan{}.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Mash @very ripe bananas{3%medium}(340 g; skins well spotted).

Whisk @&(~1)mashed banana{} with @melted unsalted butter{1/3%cup}(75 g), @light brown sugar{3/4%cup}(150 g), @eggs{2%large}, @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1 3/4%cup}(220 g), @baking soda{1%tsp}(6 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Fold @&(~1)dry mixture{} into @&(4)banana mixture{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{60%min}.
